  "description": "The Fenix SL Disc is a real endurance bicycle. It shines on all types of roads from uphill, flats and downhills to super challenging cobbles so you always enjoy your ride - anywhere the road takes you! The Fenix SL Disc shares many qualities of our top model, the Fenix SLiC endurance bicycle – albeit a tiny bit heavier. It incorporates the diamond-shaped down tube which gives extra stiffness and rigidity to this all-round bike. It also has lowered, finer seat stays which considerably increases its comfort level. Its responsiveness is also on point thanks to its wide bottom bracket and the stiff head tube. In a nutshell, it's the best endurance bicycle for someone looking for performance that combines impressive power with luxurious comfort.",
